## Summary: 4 webhook activity types, 2 dispatch paths, 1 delivery pipeline

All memo webhooks ultimately converge on `webhook.PostAsync` → `asyncPostQueue` → `webhook.Post` → `safeClient.Do(req)` in `internal/webhook/webhook.go`.

---

## Event → dispatch function pairs

| Lifecycle event (`ActivityType`) | Dispatch function | Triggered from |
|---|---|---|
| `memos.memo.created` | `DispatchMemoCreatedWebhook` | `CreateMemo` |
| `memos.memo.updated` | `DispatchMemoUpdatedWebhook` (via `dispatchMemoUpdatedSideEffects`) | `UpdateMemo`, `SetMemoAttachments`, `SetMemoRelations` |
| `memos.memo.deleted` | `DispatchMemoDeletedWebhook` | `DeleteMemo` |
| `memos.memo.comment.created` | `DispatchMemoCommentCreatedWebhook` | `CreateMemoComment` |

---

## 1. `memos.memo.created` → `DispatchMemoCreatedWebhook`

